      "description": "All participants (Participants with PS, ET, and HV) received a single dose of DaTSCAN™ ioflupane (123I) injection within the range of 111 to 185 megabecquerel (MBq) (3 to 5 millicurie \\[mCi\\]) per participant at a maximum volume of 5 milliliter \\[mL\\]) intravenously on Day 1.",
      "id": 1,
      "name": "DaTSCAN™ Ioflupane (123I) Injection",
      "other_names": [
        "Ioflupane (123I)"
      ],
      "type": {
        "authority": "clinicaltrials.gov",
